 |              |                                                               |                 |            |            | This knob is valid only for the following protocols: Stun. Monitoring allows nDPI to process the entire flow (i.e. all its packets), without any limits.          |
 |              |                                                               |                 |            |            | See doc/monitoring.md for further details                                                                                                                         |
